# ROADMAP.v5.md Part H "Deployment presets" - keeps the build context small and avoids copying
# host-platform-specific artifacts (e.g. a Windows esbuild native binary under node_modules) into a
# Linux build stage that reinstalls everything fresh anyway.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/wwwroot/js/
.git/
.claude/
**/*.user
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
